    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/436272ae3a7558f89e47b9d612947d08.avif?t=1754018139\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/d85fe0ab1caadae4456f38c53a24699c.avif?t=1754018139\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Northend Tower Defense is a unique tower defense game that unlocks and deploys powerful troops and vehicles, upgrades your army, and holds the line in an intense, multi-battlefield setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/d6859f23a957f511486e30d23e49c292.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/d6859f23a957f511486e30d23e49c292.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the chaos of battle, where every decision can mean the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/397e8498e4c92b2f96545917cd7d2a87.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/397e8498e4c92b2f96545917cd7d2a87.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the intensity of multi-front warfare, and feel the adrenaline rush as you face relentless enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/ab15877bbd6364cb507fadda4f829578.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/ab15877bbd6364cb507fadda4f829578.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/f8c0349d846028932031e2361da5e20b.avif?t=1754018139\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NETD deploys you in big battles of +20 different units, +77 unique upgrades, 4 passive powers, and 5 special abilities. Command a diverse array of units, upgrade and customize your units to adapt to the ever-changing battlefield conditions, and secure your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/bdfa74430680ca93feb6a25d6862e2ab.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/bdfa74430680ca93feb6a25d6862e2ab.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/425ca13ad2f1dcc39343f181314d2eac.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/425ca13ad2f1dcc39343f181314d2eac.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/ecc9c79ccd77c8dd4b806b2feffadb0f.avif?t=1754018139\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From beach landings to desert trenches, Northend Tower Defense's rich level design allows players to continually gain unique gameplay experiences each round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/64dfed4b720ce7f6097caa0ef5960fc5.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/64dfed4b720ce7f6097caa0ef5960fc5.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/8963c2415ff1b0d25f8c9645f70fbd37.avif?t=1754018139\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NETD Zombies introduces an entirely new gameplay experience. Deploy a variety of newly designed traps and pick up powerful airdrops, and face off against massive zombie hordes with your army. There are over 12 new powerful upgrades at your disposal. Each upgrade features 4 different levels, allowing you to shock, burn, electrify, and blow up your enemies in increasingly devastating ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/27d4b8d6a5e64599435e6b868b1be090.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/27d4b8d6a5e64599435e6b868b1be090.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/a1cf10424b1e595965b1042d10951aa0.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/a1cf10424b1e595965b1042d10951aa0.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/436272ae3a7558f89e47b9d612947d08.avif?t=1754018139\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/d85fe0ab1caadae4456f38c53a24699c.avif?t=1754018139\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Northend Tower Defense is a unique tower defense game that unlocks and deploys powerful troops and vehicles, upgrades your army, and holds the line in an intense, multi-battlefield setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/d6859f23a957f511486e30d23e49c292.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/d6859f23a957f511486e30d23e49c292.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the chaos of battle, where every decision can mean the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/397e8498e4c92b2f96545917cd7d2a87.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/397e8498e4c92b2f96545917cd7d2a87.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the intensity of multi-front warfare, and feel the adrenaline rush as you face relentless enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/ab15877bbd6364cb507fadda4f829578.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/ab15877bbd6364cb507fadda4f829578.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/f8c0349d846028932031e2361da5e20b.avif?t=1754018139\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NETD deploys you in big battles of +20 different units, +77 unique upgrades, 4 passive powers, and 5 special abilities. Command a diverse array of units, upgrade and customize your units to adapt to the ever-changing battlefield conditions, and secure your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/bdfa74430680ca93feb6a25d6862e2ab.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/bdfa74430680ca93feb6a25d6862e2ab.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/425ca13ad2f1dcc39343f181314d2eac.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/425ca13ad2f1dcc39343f181314d2eac.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/ecc9c79ccd77c8dd4b806b2feffadb0f.avif?t=1754018139\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From beach landings to desert trenches, Northend Tower Defense's rich level design allows players to continually gain unique gameplay experiences each round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/64dfed4b720ce7f6097caa0ef5960fc5.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/64dfed4b720ce7f6097caa0ef5960fc5.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/8963c2415ff1b0d25f8c9645f70fbd37.avif?t=1754018139\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NETD Zombies introduces an entirely new gameplay experience. Deploy a variety of newly designed traps and pick up powerful airdrops, and face off against massive zombie hordes with your army. There are over 12 new powerful upgrades at your disposal. Each upgrade features 4 different levels, allowing you to shock, burn, electrify, and blow up your enemies in increasingly devastating ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/27d4b8d6a5e64599435e6b868b1be090.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/27d4b8d6a5e64599435e6b868b1be090.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/a1cf10424b1e595965b1042d10951aa0.poster.avif?t=1754018139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669170/extras/a1cf10424b1e595965b1042d10951aa0.webm?t=1754018139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
